     (b) Census and municipal tables — data.opencity.in and the Pune Municipal
         Corporation, published as open data;
     (c) A GTFS extract obtained from a third-party repository;
     (d) `gadgil_poona_survey_part1.pdf` — D. R. Gadgil, "Poona: A
         Socio-Economic Survey, Part I — Economic", from the Internet Archive's
         Digital Library of India collection.
6.3  Nothing in this notice grants, restricts or otherwise affects any right in
     that third-party material, nor purports to restrict any right the ODbL
